WEBVTT

00:01:49.222 --> 00:01:53.360
This bath has so much
room, and it's nice, huh?

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:55.228
Yup.

00:01:55.228 --> 00:01:57.998
Well, you know you can come
over and use it any time you like.

00:01:57.998 --> 00:02:00.592
And since when is this your place, Princess?

00:02:01.701 --> 00:02:05.005
Wow, that would be nice, wouldn't it, Kiyone?

00:02:05.005 --> 00:02:05.939
Hmm?

00:02:05.939 --> 00:02:09.776
We've only been able to take
a bath once every three days,

00:02:09.776 --> 00:02:14.181
- since the public baths raised their prices.
- Uhh! I thought I told
you to keep your mouth shut!

00:02:14.181 --> 00:02:18.285
In that case, you can come
here every day if you like.

00:02:18.285 --> 00:02:21.388
But this isn't even your place.

00:02:21.388 --> 00:02:25.692
- Remember, this is not your place, either.
- Hey, let me in! Hey! Hey!

00:02:25.692 --> 00:02:27.561
- Hey, let me in! Hey! Hey!

00:02:27.561 --> 00:02:31.088
- Why don't you just give it up, Dad?
- Hey, let me in! Hey! Hey!

00:02:51.017 --> 00:02:53.920
Ah! Well, it's you, Tenchi.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:57.757
Hey, I'll wash your back,
and you wash mine. Deal?

00:02:57.757 --> 00:03:01.161
Wow! I want to wash his back, too.

00:03:01.161 --> 00:03:02.651
Huh?

00:03:09.269 --> 00:03:10.971
The kitchen?

00:03:10.971 --> 00:03:13.273
Washu, what's going on here?

00:03:13.273 --> 00:03:16.977
I thought the bath was in a
different dimension completely.

00:03:16.977 --> 00:03:18.877
Hey, Washu?

00:03:21.114 --> 00:03:23.378
What?

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.720
What the heck is this thing?

00:03:45.705 --> 00:03:48.642
So the bathroom was in flux, huh?

00:03:48.642 --> 00:03:51.878
It's probably because of the dimension tuner.

00:03:51.878 --> 00:03:54.981
I was just experimenting on that.

00:03:54.981 --> 00:03:56.616
Dimension tuner?

00:03:56.616 --> 00:03:58.852
Over there, you see?

00:03:58.852 --> 00:04:01.187
It's a central part of my machine.

00:04:01.187 --> 00:04:03.390
Huh?

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:08.695
But what does this machine do?
It looks so huge and weird.

00:04:08.695 --> 00:04:11.755
Controls dimensions and cause and effect.

00:04:12.799 --> 00:04:16.903
This is just my best invention
of the past 700 years!

00:04:16.903 --> 00:04:19.172
Right. Explain it again?

00:04:19.172 --> 00:04:21.841
This machine determines variable factors

00:04:21.841 --> 00:04:24.744
in time and space
based on a certain criteria.

00:04:24.744 --> 00:04:27.380
Right. Now, what's that mean?

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:31.017
With this machine, you
can create a certain nexus

00:04:31.017 --> 00:04:33.954
from the infinite possibilities
that exist in time and space.

00:04:33.954 --> 00:04:35.288
Understand now?

00:04:35.288 --> 00:04:38.086
Not at all, no.

00:04:38.959 --> 00:04:42.262
What is so difficult to understand?

00:04:42.262 --> 00:04:45.498
Why can't you explain it more clearly?

00:04:45.498 --> 00:04:47.601
All right, listen, people!

00:04:47.601 --> 00:04:51.871
This device can change the world
into whatever you want it to be!

00:04:51.871 --> 00:04:54.507
- Is that clear enough for you?
- What?

00:04:54.507 --> 00:04:55.342
No way!

00:04:55.342 --> 00:04:56.242
Really?

00:04:56.242 --> 00:05:01.448
Well, why didn't you say that
in the first place, Washu, huh?

00:05:01.448 --> 00:05:02.582
But I have been.

00:05:02.582 --> 00:05:05.719
Say, I have an idea.

00:05:05.719 --> 00:05:09.356
Do you think I could borrow
this machine for a while? Do you?

00:05:09.356 --> 00:05:12.959
Just a minute.
Could you lend it to me, Washu?

00:05:12.959 --> 00:05:15.428
Hold on. I asked her first.

00:05:15.428 --> 00:05:17.263
I have to use it first.

00:05:17.263 --> 00:05:18.732
You were too slow.

00:05:18.732 --> 00:05:22.235
I get to use it first. Keep your hands off.

00:05:22.235 --> 00:05:25.872
You want to use this
machine to get Tenchi, don't you?

00:05:25.872 --> 00:05:29.009
I am not that sneaky. Get off my back.

00:05:29.009 --> 00:05:30.944
Hey! Cut it out!

00:05:30.944 --> 00:05:35.615
First of all, this invention isn't
finished. You can't use it yet. Hmph.

00:05:35.615 --> 00:05:37.617
But I don't care if it's not finished.

00:05:37.617 --> 00:05:39.753
And I just want to see it work.

00:05:39.753 --> 00:05:40.553
No.

00:05:40.553 --> 00:05:41.921
Let me use this machine, please.

00:05:41.921 --> 00:05:44.324
I just want to try it.
I'm just curious, you know.

00:05:44.324 --> 00:05:46.226
I said no.

00:05:46.226 --> 00:05:49.362
I'd like to know how
I ended up in the kitchen.

00:05:49.362 --> 00:05:53.066
Washu is something else, isn't she?

00:05:53.066 --> 00:05:56.269
Tenchi, I think we'd better get going.

00:05:56.269 --> 00:05:58.338
Thank you for having us over.

00:05:58.338 --> 00:06:00.507
Hey, girls, it's awfully
late already, you know.

00:06:00.507 --> 00:06:03.309
Why don't you stay over here tonight?

00:06:03.309 --> 00:06:05.278
I don't want to be a burden.

00:06:05.278 --> 00:06:07.614
Really? We'd love to.

00:06:07.614 --> 00:06:09.916
We were hesitant to
go back to our apartment,

00:06:09.916 --> 00:06:12.908
because we haven't paid the rent in a while.

00:06:13.286 --> 00:06:16.483
You always say one word too many.

00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:20.126
I guess we'll be taking your offer.

00:06:20.126 --> 00:06:21.991
Thank you.

00:06:59.532 --> 00:07:02.399
Washu is not here, huh?

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:13.113
Oh, yes. Now, I know I shouldn't
let this useful machine just sit here.

00:07:13.113 --> 00:07:17.183
Let's see. The way to turn this on has to be...

00:07:17.183 --> 00:07:19.845
Hmm, is this it?

00:07:23.857 --> 00:07:25.859
? Oh, yes, I think that's it?

00:07:25.859 --> 00:07:27.894
? This world's for you and me?

00:07:27.894 --> 00:07:30.263
For you and whom, pray tell?

00:07:30.263 --> 00:07:34.029
For Tenchi and I, of course.
What do you think... Huh?!

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:39.773
What do you want?

00:07:39.773 --> 00:07:43.309
You are so sneaky, Ryoko.

00:07:43.309 --> 00:07:47.313
Well, I guess we're all just trying to
create our own ideal world, aren't we?

00:07:47.313 --> 00:07:49.482
Oh, no, that's not what I was doing.

00:07:49.482 --> 00:07:51.217
I'll tell you what I was doing.

00:07:51.217 --> 00:07:53.753
I was just trying to stop
Ryoko's treachery, that's all.

00:07:53.753 --> 00:07:56.589
What you were doing
was you were thinking about

00:07:56.589 --> 00:07:57.824
getting Tenchi with
this machine, weren't you?

00:07:57.824 --> 00:07:59.659
Go ahead, be self-righteous, Ryoko.

00:07:59.659 --> 00:08:03.129
Wow. What kind of world
do you want, Ryo-Ohki?

00:08:03.129 --> 00:08:06.499
- Ah! Don't!
- Sasami! Get out of my way.

00:08:06.499 --> 00:08:09.669
I choose...

00:08:09.669 --> 00:08:11.004
Not so fast, Ayeka.

00:08:11.004 --> 00:08:12.767
Let me go.

00:08:15.275 --> 00:08:19.078
I hope Kiyone and
I can always be partners.

00:08:19.078 --> 00:08:20.814
Whoa!

00:08:20.814 --> 00:08:22.482
Forget it. No way.

00:08:22.482 --> 00:08:25.718
I want a world totally devoid of Mihoshi.

00:08:25.718 --> 00:08:28.855
A world just for Tenchi
and me, that's what I want.

00:08:28.855 --> 00:08:31.057
- Get out of the way!
- I want my way!

00:08:31.057 --> 00:08:33.525
- Let me in there!
- I want my world!

00:08:39.299 --> 00:08:42.530
Huh? Wh-What's happening?

00:08:55.882 --> 00:08:58.112
What in the world is that?

00:08:59.619 --> 00:09:03.056
Oh, boy, I... Huh?

00:09:03.056 --> 00:09:05.325
Oh, no, my invention!

00:09:05.325 --> 00:09:08.419
What has happened to my machine?

00:09:10.129 --> 00:09:12.791
The control panel's all messed up.

00:09:25.545 --> 00:09:28.878
I can't stop it now. The machine
is totally out of my control.

00:09:33.052 --> 00:09:35.788
Listen up. Everyone
here soon will be traveling

00:09:35.788 --> 00:09:38.625
through entangled time and space.

00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:42.395
It's possible we could all drift
through many worlds forever.

00:09:42.395 --> 00:09:46.456
I'll try to fix this
dimension tuner somehow and...

00:09:48.034 --> 00:09:49.269
Washu!

00:09:49.269 --> 00:09:51.170
What's going to happen to us now?

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:52.639
How should I know?

00:09:52.639 --> 00:09:54.504
Washu!

00:09:59.245 --> 00:10:01.338
This is really strange.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:05.240
Huh?

00:10:22.502 --> 00:10:27.040
Everyone here will soon be traveling
through entangled time and space.

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:31.374
We could drift through the
many possible worlds forever.

00:10:51.698 --> 00:10:53.199
Lady Ayeka.

00:10:53.199 --> 00:10:55.224
Lord Tenchi...

00:10:56.002 --> 00:10:58.805
Lord Tenchi...

00:10:58.805 --> 00:11:00.740
When did you get here?

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.775
Just a moment ago.

00:11:02.775 --> 00:11:06.079
I suddenly felt an urge to see you.

00:11:06.079 --> 00:11:08.548
Oh, Tenchi, I am flattered.

00:11:08.548 --> 00:11:10.350
Oh, Ayeka.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.409
Oh, Tenchi.

00:11:15.355 --> 00:11:17.523
"Ra"

00:11:17.523 --> 00:11:20.287
"Rasho-mon"

00:11:29.135 --> 00:11:31.337
The demon at Rasho-mon?

00:11:31.337 --> 00:11:35.441
Yes, Ayeka. The emperor directly
ordered that I subdue the demon

00:11:35.441 --> 00:11:38.544
that has been terrorizing the capital.

00:11:38.544 --> 00:11:40.346
That's dangerous.

00:11:40.346 --> 00:11:43.282
I have to, for our nation.

00:11:43.282 --> 00:11:46.019
Please try to understand, Ayeka.

00:11:46.019 --> 00:11:47.153
Oh...

00:11:47.153 --> 00:11:49.212
Be careful, Tenchi.

00:11:52.358 --> 00:11:54.027
Three...

00:11:54.027 --> 00:11:55.395
Four...

00:11:55.395 --> 00:11:57.764
Five, Six.

00:11:57.764 --> 00:12:02.535
Mihoshi, Kiyone, I really
appreciate that you came.

00:12:02.535 --> 00:12:05.538
- My pleasure.
- Oh, really, don't mention it.

00:12:05.538 --> 00:12:07.940
My fiancé Lord Tenchi is assigned to go

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:11.911
on an expedition against
the demon at Rasho-mon.

00:12:11.911 --> 00:12:14.013
I am sure you have heard of this.

00:12:14.013 --> 00:12:15.581
Oh, certainly.

00:12:15.581 --> 00:12:18.311
It happens to be the talk of the town.

00:12:20.353 --> 00:12:23.489
You know our wedding is coming up.

00:12:23.489 --> 00:12:26.692
I do not know what I will do
if anything happens to him.

00:12:26.692 --> 00:12:31.230
I just don't know.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.598
You must be worried.

00:12:32.598 --> 00:12:33.966
I understand your concern.

00:12:33.966 --> 00:12:37.003
You'll be an old maid if you
miss this opportunity, right?

00:12:37.003 --> 00:12:38.037
What did you say?

00:12:38.037 --> 00:12:39.272
I was saying...

00:12:39.272 --> 00:12:42.375
Now, how may we be of service?

00:12:42.375 --> 00:12:48.114
Well, I was hoping that you two
could assist Tenchi with his quest.

00:12:48.114 --> 00:12:50.149
The demon at Rasho-mon...

00:12:50.149 --> 00:12:53.386
is known to be the most
wicked villain, isn't she?

00:12:53.386 --> 00:12:55.688
She's committed numerous crimes

00:12:55.688 --> 00:13:00.326
and anyone who has ever tried to
capture her has never come back alive.

00:13:00.326 --> 00:13:05.298
You two are the most
competent policemen I know.

00:13:05.298 --> 00:13:07.700
Please?

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.702
We are public officials.

00:13:09.702 --> 00:13:12.905
We have other duties we must fulfill.

00:13:12.905 --> 00:13:14.407
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

00:13:14.407 --> 00:13:16.242
What a pity.

00:13:16.242 --> 00:13:18.711
I was going to make you
executives at the police department,

00:13:18.711 --> 00:13:25.879
if you successfully
completed my assignment.

00:13:28.988 --> 00:13:31.957
Lady Ayeka, do you really mean that?

00:13:33.092 --> 00:13:36.329
Oh, no! I'm scared!

00:13:36.329 --> 00:13:37.196
All right, then.

00:13:37.196 --> 00:13:41.467
We'll do it, and we'll not let you down.

00:13:41.467 --> 00:13:43.603
Really? How nice.

00:13:43.603 --> 00:13:47.406
The public safety of the capital
is our business as police officers.

00:13:47.406 --> 00:13:49.842
Rest assured that you
won't be disappointed.

00:13:49.842 --> 00:13:52.778
Oh, Kiyone.

00:13:52.778 --> 00:13:54.473
Lady Ayeka.

00:13:57.483 --> 00:14:00.884
I don't want to fight the demon!

00:14:07.393 --> 00:14:11.659
"Rasho-mon"

00:14:13.232 --> 00:14:15.968
Hey, Ryoko!

00:14:15.968 --> 00:14:17.703
Ryoko, hey!

00:14:17.703 --> 00:14:19.505
I know you are up there!

00:14:19.505 --> 00:14:21.340
Ryoko, hey!

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.706
Ah, Tenchi.

00:14:25.945 --> 00:14:28.614
I'm glad you came, Tenchi.

00:14:28.614 --> 00:14:31.310
You don't have to go
anywhere else today, do you?

00:14:33.419 --> 00:14:36.122
I've got bad news for you.

00:14:36.122 --> 00:14:40.326
I was ordered to subjugate
the demon at Rasho-mon.

00:14:40.326 --> 00:14:42.795
Oh, that'll be tough.

00:14:42.795 --> 00:14:45.631
Well, let me help you, Tenchi.

00:14:45.631 --> 00:14:48.935
What are you talking about?
You are the demon.

00:14:48.935 --> 00:14:51.165
Oh, I am, huh?

00:14:52.038 --> 00:14:54.040
No! I'm so terrified!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.235
Quit wasting time.
You're coming with me.

00:14:56.509 --> 00:14:59.212
Kiyone, I really don't
think this is a good idea.

00:14:59.212 --> 00:15:01.414
Our promotions are at stake.

00:15:01.414 --> 00:15:05.585
We'll stay at the lowest rank forever
if we waste this chance, Mihoshi.

00:15:05.585 --> 00:15:07.286
Is that what you want?

00:15:07.286 --> 00:15:10.189
But we'll be eaten by the monster!

00:15:10.189 --> 00:15:11.924
Stop whining and get over here!

00:15:11.924 --> 00:15:14.290
No!

00:15:19.298 --> 00:15:22.301
It's your fault.

00:15:22.301 --> 00:15:24.070
You shouldn't have committed
one crime after another.

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:26.505
Oh, well. Let's not worry about it.

00:15:26.505 --> 00:15:28.407
What will be will be.

00:15:28.407 --> 00:15:32.712
Ryoko, try to understand
my position, will you?

00:15:32.712 --> 00:15:36.849
There's nothing we can do because
nobody knows how intimate we are

00:15:36.849 --> 00:15:38.384
with each other, do they, Tenchi?

00:15:38.384 --> 00:15:40.653
Don't talk like that.

00:15:40.653 --> 00:15:42.888
Talk like that can be very misleading.

00:15:42.888 --> 00:15:46.325
Well, you know we've already
come to the point of no return.

00:15:46.325 --> 00:15:47.260
What?

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:52.465
But I suppose you and I could
just run away right now, couldn't we?

00:15:52.465 --> 00:15:53.933
Hey, stop that!

00:15:53.933 --> 00:15:55.768
Don't you think it's a brilliant idea?

00:15:55.768 --> 00:15:57.169
Cut it out! Stay away from me!

00:15:57.169 --> 00:16:00.806
I don't want anybody to see us together!

00:16:00.806 --> 00:16:04.139
Oh, what's taking you
so long? Climb up here.

00:16:05.144 --> 00:16:06.509
Let's go, okay?

00:16:08.914 --> 00:16:12.118
Tenchi, we are here as your backup.

00:16:12.118 --> 00:16:16.248
Now that we're here, you'll
definitely have the upper hand, Tenchi.

00:16:18.357 --> 00:16:19.759
Tenchi, you are...

00:16:19.759 --> 00:16:23.195
The demon's secret boyfriend, huh?

00:16:23.195 --> 00:16:26.032
Oh, no, now, really,
this is not what you think.

00:16:26.032 --> 00:16:28.968
Well, there, so now you know.

00:16:28.968 --> 00:16:31.436
Just don't leak this
information to the press, though.

00:16:35.608 --> 00:16:42.014
Thank you so much. Thank you
for your understanding, Kiyone.

00:16:42.014 --> 00:16:44.483
Well, we didn't have much of a choice.

00:16:44.483 --> 00:16:47.586
Don't let Ayeka know
about any of this, please.

00:16:47.586 --> 00:16:49.021
Of course not.

00:16:49.021 --> 00:16:51.590
If Ayeka found out about any of this,

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:54.760
I'd be in big trouble,
too, you know, Tenchi.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.195
Sorry about that.

00:16:56.195 --> 00:17:01.133
I passed the message on to Mihoshi,
too, so there shouldn't be any mix-ups.

00:17:01.133 --> 00:17:04.159
It was quite a shock to me, you know.

00:17:05.371 --> 00:17:09.275
Who would have thought that Tenchi
and the demon were an item, huh?

00:17:09.275 --> 00:17:11.544
It's so scandalous, don't you think?

00:17:11.544 --> 00:17:16.038
But they seemed to be very close.

00:17:19.318 --> 00:17:21.053
Do you have a minute, Tenchi?

00:17:21.053 --> 00:17:22.221
Sure.

00:17:22.221 --> 00:17:25.257
Uh, Ayeka, why are you here?

00:17:25.257 --> 00:17:30.062
I was so worried about you,
and so I came to check on you, Tenchi.

00:17:30.062 --> 00:17:32.292
What do you have to say for yourself?

00:17:33.399 --> 00:17:36.769
You don't mean to tell me,
you really believe all that stuff?

00:17:36.769 --> 00:17:38.471
Y-You know she's nuts.

00:17:38.471 --> 00:17:39.372
Are you sure?

00:17:39.372 --> 00:17:41.207
I am so certain.

00:17:41.207 --> 00:17:43.609
Kiyone, if I find out that you are lying,

00:17:43.609 --> 00:17:46.712
I will make sure you get demoted.

00:17:46.712 --> 00:17:50.580
- De-De-Demoted?
- Yup!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.485
Tenchi.

00:17:52.485 --> 00:17:55.721
Come on. It's time to get out of here.

00:17:55.721 --> 00:17:57.890
Ryoko? What are you doing here?

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.256
What, like we didn't plan this?

00:18:00.693 --> 00:18:04.563
We decided to run away
together, you and I, didn't we?

00:18:04.563 --> 00:18:08.267
I couldn't wait any longer, so
I went ahead and packed my stuff.

00:18:08.267 --> 00:18:11.704
All right, Tenchi, I want you
to tell me, who is this woman?

00:18:11.704 --> 00:18:13.606
Woman? Ah...

00:18:13.606 --> 00:18:15.541
Wait a minute. Who are you?

00:18:15.541 --> 00:18:19.845
I am Tenchi's official fiancée, that's all.

00:18:19.845 --> 00:18:23.816
Well, I guess that makes
me his official mistress, then.

00:18:23.816 --> 00:18:26.152
Not true!

00:18:26.152 --> 00:18:29.922
Are you what people call
the demon of Rasho-mon?

00:18:29.922 --> 00:18:32.458
There you go. So you already knew about us.

00:18:32.458 --> 00:18:34.619
Don't we make a fantastic couple?

00:18:36.929 --> 00:18:42.134
Just what does this woman have that I don't?
Can you tell me that, Tenchi? Huh? Can you?

00:18:42.134 --> 00:18:45.104
Hey, what do you think
you're doing to my man?

00:18:45.104 --> 00:18:46.605
What do you mean, your man?

00:18:46.605 --> 00:18:48.841
He is not your man.

00:18:48.841 --> 00:18:50.342
And get off your high horse.

00:18:50.342 --> 00:18:52.945
Hey, who do you think you're talking to?

00:18:52.945 --> 00:18:55.971
To the girl that got dumped by Tenchi.

00:18:57.516 --> 00:19:00.883
You just do not know when to stop!

00:19:02.188 --> 00:19:03.815
Hmm.

00:19:06.725 --> 00:19:08.594
Everything is totally messed up.

00:19:08.594 --> 00:19:13.531
The only thing left for me to do is to
eliminate the multiple worlds one by one.

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:19.205
You hold still!

00:19:19.205 --> 00:19:21.273
Hold still, and I'll finish you myself!

00:19:21.273 --> 00:19:23.542
Whoa! Watch out!

00:19:23.542 --> 00:19:25.009
I'll hold still.

00:19:32.985 --> 00:19:35.647
Prepare to die!

00:19:36.922 --> 00:19:38.324
Take this!

00:19:38.324 --> 00:19:41.919
Not good enough for me.

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.805
Here's the demon. Come on. Right here.

00:19:52.805 --> 00:19:54.874
You are a demon, aren't you?

00:19:54.874 --> 00:19:57.610
Lady Ayeka, you must calm down.

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.475
You must be demoted!

00:20:06.552 --> 00:20:10.890
There. Now this dimension is closed.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.586
Let's eliminate the first one. Cancel.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:20.799
Kiyone, get ahold of yourself.

00:20:20.799 --> 00:20:23.602
Tenchi, let's run away together.

00:20:23.602 --> 00:20:27.038
I told you. Lord Tenchi is my fiancé.

00:20:40.386 --> 00:20:41.554
"Tenchi Muyo: Time and Space Adventures"

00:20:41.554 --> 00:20:45.391
"Tenchi Muyo: Time and Space Adventures"
Thus begins the special
episodes of Tenchi Muyo.

00:20:45.391 --> 00:20:45.791
Thus begins the special
episodes of Tenchi Muyo.

00:20:45.791 --> 00:20:49.161
Tenchi and the whole gang have
traveled through time and space.

00:20:49.161 --> 00:20:52.798
What kind of world do
you think awaits them next?

00:20:52.798 --> 00:20:58.504
Will they ever be able to come
back to their original world?

00:20:58.504 --> 00:21:02.641
Watch Tenchi Muyo: "Time
and Space Adventures Part II."

00:21:02.641 --> 00:21:05.735
We look forward to seeing you there.

00:22:58.457 --> 00:23:02.161
In the high school world,
Ryoko is a juvenile delinquent

00:23:02.161 --> 00:23:04.963
and Ayeka is class president,
when a mysterious girl appears.

00:23:04.963 --> 00:23:07.166
Now transform into Pretty Sammy!

00:23:07.166 --> 00:23:11.537
Okay, Ryo-Ohki! Jugem,
jugem, gokoh-no-surikire...

00:23:11.537 --> 00:23:14.807
Sammy Davis broiler chicken!

00:23:14.807 --> 00:23:17.109
What is the true identity of Pretty Sammy?

00:23:17.109 --> 00:23:20.279
Next episode is:
"Time and Space Adventures Part II."

00:23:20.279 --> 00:23:22.577
It's unquestionably glamorous!
